  "details": "Recently, my camera's resolution setting has been automatically reverting to FHD.\n\nI always want to take photos in 4K resolution, so I have it set to 4K, but it somehow changes to FHD.\n\nI thought it might be due to an app update, but today, after taking a picture with a friend and then sleeping and waking up in VRChat, I took a picture of a note, and the resolution was FHD.\n\nDuring this time, the VRChat app was running.\n\nOther friends have also mentioned experiencing this issue, so it's not just happening to me.",
